\item \code{list(type = "delta", value = v)}: \code{g = b + v};
\item \code{list(type = "level", value = v)}: \code{g = v}.
}

\strong{Priorities.} Each priority level minimizes the weighted sum of the
penalized deviations of its goals; the levels are solved in order, each
